/**
 * Template: ComboStore.
 *
 * The platform's own marketing site, https://combostore.bd (combostore-admin's
 * components/ComboStoreLanding.jsx, English copy from messages/en.json),
 * rebuilt with page-builder blocks: Header, Footer, Home and the three legal
 * pages. Applying it leaves every other page as it is.
 *
 * GENERATED by a script; it is plain data, so edit freely.
 *
 * DESIGN (Tailwind stops only, as on the site)
 *
 *   emerald-600 primary (buttons, monogram, checks, icon tiles), emerald-400
 *   on the dark bands, emerald-50/100 tints; zinc-950 the architecture,
 *   templates and closing panels; zinc-50 the banded sections; zinc-200
 *   hairlines. Geist for everything (template meta).
 *
 * HEADER  sticky, white/85 with a blur: CS monogram + wordmark, six anchor
 *   links (#platform #features #builder #templates #payments #pricing),
 *   Deploy on Vercel (/onboard); a slide-in menu under lg.
 *
 * HOME (section anchors in brackets)
 *   hero [top] - admin mock, a tabs block (Orders, Products, Insights,
 *   Storefront) with two floating cards - partner strip - proof numbers -
 *   architecture [platform] - twelve modules [features], each with its
 *   dashboard screenshot (public/templates/combostore/*.png) or, for Stock,
 *   Team and Support, a card of its features - page builder [builder] with
 *   an element-category tabs block and the AI section card - templates
 *   gallery [templates] from public/templates/*.svg - AI assistant [ai] with
 *   Product / Blog / Template tabs - payments [payments] tabbed by wallets,
 *   gateways and cash - couriers [couriers] - integrations [integrations] -
 *   pricing [pricing], a Monthly / Yearly tabs block - FAQ accordion [faq] -
 *   closing call to action [contact].
 *
 * LEGAL  Terms of Service [terms], Privacy Policy [privacy] and Refund Policy
 *   [refund] - combostore-admin app/{terms,privacy,refund}/page.jsx, with the
 *   facts from components/legal/company.js filled in. Each installs with its
 *   type as the slug, so the catch-all route serves it at /terms, /privacy and
 *   /refund, the footer links. Every section has its id as an anchor, linked
 *   from the "On this page" list. The page header and footer come from the
 *   template rather than the site's own back-to-site bar, and the draft
 *   banner is left out (company.js has no placeholders left).
 *
 * Not carried over from the site: the EN / Bangla switch (the storefront
 * has no translations), the feature search, the scrolling partner marquee
 * and the screenshot lightbox. "Deploy on Vercel" and the plan buttons
 * point at /onboard, the site's onboarding route; change them if this
 * store does not have it.
 */

